<title>UK: Indian Railway Finance Corp sets $150 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Indian Railway Finance Corp sets $150 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager ANZ Investment Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INDIAN RAILWAY FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +75 BP    PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   50 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  INDIA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	100 PCT MAINTENANCE OF GOVERNMENT OWNERSHIP AND</p>
<p>		COMFORT LETTER FROM MINISTRY OF RAILWAYS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
